---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HomeHero from '../components/HomeHero.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Ethnoir | Practical support for founders and the organizations serving them"
  description="Ethnoir helps entrepreneurship-support organizations connect participant needs with practical decisions about support, delivery and measurement."
>
  <!-- SECTION 1: HERO -->
  <HomeHero />

  <!-- SECTION: ONE ANSWER RARELY FITS -->
  <section class="bg-porcelain chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); line-height: 1.15;">
          The same advice does not fit every business.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 md-col-7 md-col-8-offset">
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          A founder testing a first offer, an owner whose sales swing from month to month and someone deciding whether to close a business are asking different questions.
        </p>
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
          Ethnoir starts with what is happening in the business and where its owner wants it to go, not with a single score, stage or formula.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: TWO GROUPS -->
  <section class="bg-parchment chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      
      <!-- Group 1: Founders -->
      <div class="col-12 md-col-6 thin-rule-y" style="padding-right: var(--space-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
        <span class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">
          For founders and business owners
        </span>
        <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.875rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Not sure what to work on first?
        </h3>
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
          The Venture Readiness Check-In is a short self-check across customers, sales, operations, money and your own capacity. Explore how it works and what the result can help you consider.
        </p>
        <a href="/venture-readiness-check-in" class="btn-primary" style="background-color: var(--color-tidal-ink); color: var(--color-porcelain); text-decoration: none; align-self: flex-start; display: inline-block;">
          Explore the Check-In &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Group 2: Organizations -->
      <div class="col-12 md-col-6" style="padding-left: var(--space-md); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
        <span class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">
          For organizations that support entrepreneurs
        </span>
        <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.875rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Does your support fit the people it is meant to serve?
        </h3>
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
          Bring a question about participant needs, confusing entry routes, support that is hard to use, or evidence that does not answer the questions behind a decision. Ethnoir can help examine the issue and define practical changes. A first conversation establishes the question, fit and possible scope.
        </p>
        <a href="/for-organizations" class="link-secondary voice-3" style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); font-weight: 500; display: inline-block;">
          For Organizations &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: WHAT ETHNOIR DOES -->
  <section class="bg-porcelain chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 2.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); line-height: 1.15;">
          What Ethnoir does
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12 md-col-7 md-col-8-offset">
        <div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);">
          
          <div style="padding: var(--space-md) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);">
            <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: 6px;">
              Understand the situation.
            </h3>
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
              We examine the available information about a business or the people receiving support, separate evidence from assumptions and identify what needs closer attention.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="padding: var(--space-md) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);">
            <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: 6px;">
              Shape a practical response.
            </h3>
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
              We translate that understanding into support activities, materials, delivery processes and follow-up. A new program is one possible response; an existing service or workflow may need a simpler change.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="padding: var(--space-md) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);">
            <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: 6px;">
              Learn what to change.
            </h3>
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
              We define what to examine, review what happened and use the evidence to decide what to keep, change or test.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div style="background-color: var(--color-parchment); padding: var(--space-md); border-left: 2px solid var(--color-deep-teal); margin-top: var(--space-lg);">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin: 0; font-weight: 500;">
            The focus is the connection between what founders are dealing with and the support they can use. Program design, delivery systems and measurement are ways to work on that connection.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: EVIDENCE -->
  <section class="bg-quiet-sand chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); line-height: 1.15; max-width: 800px;">
          What Ethnoir has actually done
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12 md-col-9" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.1875rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink);">
          In summer 2026 Ethnoir designed and ran the Venture Readiness Lab, a six-week virtual pilot in which founders each worked on one problem in their own business. We built the session sequence, workbooks and exercises, ran six weekly sessions and two office hours, tracked attendance, reviewed what founders produced and recorded what to change.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Architectural Fact Strip -->
      <div class="col-12" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
        <div class="fact-strip-container">
          <div class="fact-item">
            <span class="fact-number voice-1">6 weeks</span>
            <span class="fact-desc voice-3">June 24–July 31, 2026</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fact-item">
            <span class="fact-number voice-1">6 active founders</span>
            <span class="fact-desc voice-3">reached the final session</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fact-item">
            <span class="fact-number voice-1">5 deliverables</span>
            <span class="fact-desc voice-3">reviewed and confirmed by the Founder</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Limitation / Evaluation Disclosure -->
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          The Founder personally reviewed and confirmed five participant-created business deliverables. Read the case study for the work, participant perspectives and what the evidence supports.
        </p>
        
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-md); padding: var(--space-sm) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);">
          <p class="voice-3" style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin: 0; font-weight: 500;">
            This activity received support from NC IDEA.
          </p>
          <img
            src="/images/nc-idea-logo.svg"
            alt="NC IDEA"
            width="90"
            height="24"
            style="height: 22px; width: auto; opacity: 0.85;"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12">
        <a href="/our-work" class="btn-primary" style="background-color: var(--color-tidal-ink); color: var(--color-porcelain); text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;">
          View Our Work &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: FOUNDER -->
  <section class="bg-parchment chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12" style="align-items: center;">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
        <div class="editorial-image-container" style="max-width: 320px; border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);">
          <picture>
            <source srcset="/images/ola.webp" type="image/webp" />
            <img
              src="/images/ola.jpeg"
              alt="Olajumoke Michael, Founder of Ethnoir"
              class="editorial-image"
              width="722"
              height="1080"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              style="aspect-ratio: 4/5; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"
              onerror="this.style.display='none';"
            />
          </picture>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12 md-col-7 md-col-8-offset">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md); line-height: 1.15;">
          Olajumoke Michael
        </h2>
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
          Olajumoke founded Ethnoir in 2025 and leads it from Winston-Salem, North Carolina. Her earlier work covers entrepreneurship support, program delivery, institutional operations and program learning across nonprofit, higher-education, government and economic-development settings.
        </p>
        <a href="/about" class="link-secondary voice-3" style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); font-weight: 500; display: inline-block;">
          About Ethnoir &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: CLOSING INVITATION -->
  <section class="bg-tidal-ink chapter chapter-large-spacing">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-9" style="max-width: 840px;">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem); color: var(--color-porcelain); line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: var(--space-md); letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
          Bring us a specific question.
        </h2>
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-parchment); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
          Describe a decision about the support you offer, a difficulty in how people access or use it, or a question your current evidence cannot answer. We can discuss whether a defined piece of work would be useful.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-lg);">
          <a href="/contact?type=institutional" class="btn-primary" style="background-color: var(--color-porcelain); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); text-decoration: none;">
            Discuss an entrepreneurship-support challenge
          </a>
          <a href="/our-work" class="link-secondary voice-3" style="color: var(--color-parchment); font-size: 1rem;">
            View Our Work &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .col-12 { grid-column: span 12; }
  
  .fact-strip-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    background-color: var(--color-parchment);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);
  }
  
  .fact-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);
  }
  
  .fact-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }
  
  .fact-number {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--color-tidal-ink);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  
  .fact-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-muted-slate);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .md-col-10 { grid-column: span 10; }
    .md-col-9 { grid-column: span 9; }
    .md-col-8 { grid-column: span 8; }
    .md-col-7 { grid-column: span 7; }
    .md-col-6 { grid-column: span 6; }
    .md-col-4 { grid-column: span 4; }
    .md-col-8-offset { grid-column: 5 / span 8; }

    .fact-strip-container {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
    
    .fact-item {
      padding-bottom: 0;
      border-bottom: none;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);
      padding-right: var(--space-md);
    }
    
    .fact-item:last-child {
      border-right: none;
      padding-right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
